@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+# N26 conditional CPU preparation: clean-output RBF input
+
+This is CPU preparation only. N25 remains the active, immutable GPU7 Dev experiment. N25 promotion takes priority for independent validation. No N26 online candidate, plan, budget amendment, GPU/model/API/simulator work or protected evaluation is released here. Any later N26 deployment requires N25 terminal disposition, independent source/native arithmetic review, a complete prospective matched protocol and actual capacity checks.
+
+## Basis and single intervention
+
+Base commit: 5a65ef15968cc68c82314e8c0773b3365ad45fa0. Scientific parent: candidate_n25, including clipped quality, N7 QD descriptor and N5 selector, with N24 parent rescue OFF. Root's static review is ../n25_actuator_clipped_rbf/clean-estimate-rbf-static-review-v1/root-review-v1.json (SHA256 0d32aa307f28720d876b512900f6b0a59f102399c73a9552e08d1b4302c46363). The resolved frozen scheduler uses prediction_type=sample. This establishes the output's static clean-estimate semantics, not accuracy, physical feasibility or benefit.
+
+Exactly one algorithmic change: in both existing initial and rollout active RBF calls, replace the noisy population/x_t argument with the SAME already-computed, as-yet-unmodified model_output. Treat that output as an independent detached leaf for the existing clipped EEF potential gradient, then apply the existing negative masked scale20 update to model_output before the existing scheduler.step. There is no model backward, noisy-input Jacobian, straight-through surrogate, second forward or alpha/sigma rescaling. Runtime prediction_type must be sample; reject absent/other prediction type explicitly rather than silently falling back. Preserve native dtype/device/layout; do not add an empirical tolerance or implicit FP32 geometry conversion.
+
+Keep N25's mathematical helper, strict-interior clipping derivative, first8 translation39/40/41, original16 per-row projector/origin reads, .01 cumulative projection, potential epsilons, global norm/threshold, sign, scales20, schedules/skip0, RNG, scheduler history, population16, iterations10, 176 canonical evaluations/11 scores unchanged. A full guided search nominally has21 forward calls and19 active RBF calls. These are distinct counters, not interchangeable cost measures. Actual overhead remains measured, not claimed equal. Do not alter QD/quality/descriptor/archive/allocation/final selection, executed-action semantics, Stage/perception/provider/cache/prompt, simulator or pretrained weights. No other mechanism is combined.
+
+Use an explicit default-off input-source option (preferred diversity_input_source with noisy_sample default and model_output_sample_v1 opt-in) shared by initial and rollout. Reject unsupported combinations for the new option; existing defaults and N25 paths retain their prior behavior. If this exact option cannot be threaded safely, report the concrete source conflict before adopting a different scientific definition. No active W source changes.
+
+## Bounded source and CPU deliverables
+
